## SUCCESS CRITERIA

Each workstream must deliver:

**DEBT-3:** findings_rate anomaly detection online, z-score logs in metrics.json, dashboard showing metrics history
**DEBT-6:** tool ROI tracked per-phase, suggestions appearing in scan reports, applying to next scan
**DEBT-7:** RAG queries returning similar findings, per-program isolation verified, Phase 5 integration working
**DEBT-9:** multi-target queue reordering by priority, parallel phase execution tested, fairness constraint enforced
**GAP-10:** Phase 2.5 discovering private endpoints, Phase 4 running multi-user tests, IDOR bugs detected, credentials encrypted

